13:48.494 --> 13:51.190
Meg, who let you back in the house?

13:53.866 --> 13:55.925
Oh, Karin. Come on in.

13:56.035 --> 13:58.663
Lois, I got your new headshots,
and I set up a shoot for you...

13:58.771 --> 14:00.398
