14:56.929 --> 14:59.796
Excuse me?
Who do you think you are, my father?

14:59.899 --> 15:01.389
Lois, I think Meg was right.

15:01.500 --> 15:04.264
Lowering yourself and women
and something and all that noise.

15:04.370 --> 15:06.429
You can't stop me from modeling, Peter.

15:06.538 --> 15:08.062
